Split router across multiple files

I would like to know, what is the proposed way to split the routes of a router (@router.get functions) across two or more files? I couldn't find an example in the docs.

I will add an example to clarify:

    # file_1.py
    @router.get('/hello')
    def hello():
        return None

    # file_2.py
    @router.get('/bye')
    def bye():
         return None
